          "en": "An article is added to the Criminal Law after Article 133 as Article 133bis, which reads: Where a person drives a motor vehicle on a road to chase and race, where the circumstances are flagrant, or drives a motor vehicle on a road while intoxicated, he shall be sentenced to criminal detention and a fine.\nWhere a person commits an act under the preceding paragraph which simultaneously constitutes another crime, he shall be convicted and punished in accordance with the provisions providing for a heavier punishment."
